{"assumption_ids":[],"boundary":"The evidence mapping records a Lean proof of exactly this statement. Lean status per paper is kept in authored/evidence-status.json.","citation_ids":["cite.long.thm-greedy-survival-record"],"evidence_ids":["mapping.long.thm-greedy-survival-record"],"id":"long.thm-greedy-survival-record","kind":"claim","label":"Long record Theorem 5.10 (Membership equals greedy survival at every level)","locator":"Long record Theorem 5.10, p. 40, label thm:greedy-survival-record","source_id":"paper.long.pdf","statement":"*For a real $x$, let $r_n(x)$ be its greedy remainder after rank $n$, and let $R_n=\\sum_{j>n}w_j$, as in the initial notation. Then\n$$\nx\\in\\mathcal A\\quad\\Longleftrightarrow\\quad\n x\\ge0\\ \\text{and}\\ r_n(x)\\le R_n\\text{ for every }n\\ge0.\n$$\nThe inequality says that the unselected tail has enough total mass at every rank. A failure at any one rank excludes membership; the inequalities at all ranks give a representation.*","status":"unverified"},"ref":"sha256:264b08973a5f23b2f98ad989b0c1708096513d86929f19048623a2a9fe18092c/nodes/long.thm-greedy-survival-record","relations":[{"derived":false,"family":"arguments","from":"sha256:264b08973a5f23b2f98ad989b0c1708096513d86929f19048623a2a9fe18092c/nodes/long.thm-greedy-survival-record","id":"sha256:264b08973a5f23b2f98ad989b0c1708096513d86929f19048623a2a9fe18092c/edges/%5B%22long.thm-greedy-survival-record%22%2C%22lean.Erdos249257.greedy_survives_of_mem_mersenneAchievementSet%22%2C%22formalizes%22%5D","kind":"formalizes","record_ref":"sha256:264b08973a5f23b2f98ad989b0c1708096513d86929f19048623a2a9fe18092c/edges/%5B%22long.thm-greedy-survival-record%22%2C%22lean.Erdos249257.greedy_survives_of_mem_mersenneAchievementSet%22%2C%22formalizes%22%5D","semantic_class":"formalization_correspondence","to":"sha256:264b08973a5f23b2f98ad989b0c1708096513d86929f19048623a2a9fe18092c/nodes/lean.Erdos249257.greedy_survives_of_mem_mersenneAchievementSet"},{"derived":false,"family":"arguments","fro